Then they have to execute

00:33:30.800 --> 00:33:33.920
the complicated dual reclassification filings

00:33:33.920 --> 00:33:37.520
for the Central Medical Hospitals by December 2026.

00:33:37.520 --> 00:33:38.760
So a month later.

00:33:38.760 --> 00:33:40.680
And then comes the big public push

00:33:40.680 --> 00:33:43.000
because by June of 2027,

00:33:43.000 --> 00:33:47.160
they need to generate 150 plus highly substantive

00:33:47.160 --> 00:33:49.640
data-driven comments on the federal docket.

00:33:49.640 --> 00:33:51.040
They have to permanently fix

00:33:51.040 --> 00:33:53.200
that four of nine, eight, two embarrassment.

00:33:53.200 --> 00:33:54.400
They really do.

00:33:54.400 --> 00:33:56.720
They are organizing all 52 hospitals,

00:33:56.720 --> 00:33:58.520
the Medicare Advantage Insurance Plans,

00:33:58.520 --> 00:33:59.880
the medical societies,

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:01.880
the mayors of the local municipalities

00:34:01.880 --> 00:34:03.520
and patient advocacy groups

00:34:03.520 --> 00:34:06.320
to all file coordinated legally sound comments

00:34:06.320 --> 00:34:07.960
based on this shared strategy.

00:34:07.960 --> 00:34:11.840
It is a massive island wide coalition building effort.

00:34:11.840 --> 00:34:13.520
And the messaging strategy they are using

00:34:13.520 --> 00:34:15.400
to unite all these disparate groups

00:34:15.400 --> 00:34:18.000
is explicitly stated in the documents.

00:34:18.000 --> 00:34:20.480
Sell the certainty, build the option.

00:34:20.480 --> 00:34:22.560
Right, sell the certainty, build the option.

00:34:22.560 --> 00:34:23.400
I love that phrasing.

00:34:23.400 --> 00:34:24.440
It's very smart.

00:34:24.440 --> 00:34:26.600
They are telling their coalition,

00:34:26.600 --> 00:34:28.720
we must mobilize right now

